# account-authorisation

Hand-written text.

<!-- use-case-instances:start -->
Each instance is a contract in `<scheme>/src/main.nr`, entrypoint `entrypoint(payload, auth)`, package `<scheme>_auth_account`, tested by `scripts/test-use-cases.sh account-authorisation/<scheme>` (no TXE tests for google). Its `src/test.nr` has the tests `valid`, `replay_rejected`, `wrong_issuer_rejected`, `wrong_action_rejected`, `wrong_policy_rejected`, `expired_rejected`; [use-cases.json](../use-cases.json) records each exception and its reason. The category is the evidence category of [ARCHITECTURE.md](../ARCHITECTURE.md#evidence-and-authority).

